# --- LaTeX Build Artifacts (Ignore these) ---
# These are generated automatically when you compile.
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.lof
*.lot

# --- Final Output ---
# Standard practice is to ignore the generated PDF to avoid large file history
# and merge conflicts. If you WANT to track the PDF, remove this line.
*.pdf

# --- OS & Editor System Files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/

# --- EXCEPTIONS (Force Git to track these if strict rules exist) ---
# Ensuring these specific style/bib files are never ignored
!acl.sty
!acl_natbib.bst

report iterations plus misc
*.zip